a. The protein in hair, ﬁngernails, and spiderwebs (keratin) is a  structural protein, as is collagen. b. Hemoglobin, a major protein  in red blood cells, is involved in transporting oxygen. c. The  contractile proteins actin and myosin cause muscles to move.
